    "E": "indicative of an exudative pleural effusion but not specific for PPF"
  },
  "rationale": "The report states that pleural fluid amylase values of at least 1000 IU/L are pathognomonic for pancreatopleural fistula (PPF). A value of 6118 U/L is well above that cutoff, so it meets the report’s pathognomonic criterion."
}

